### 3. Additional context (if relevant):                                                                                
Decisions were made based on the presence of index tests (CT, MRI, PET, EUS, etc.) and reference standards              
(histopathology or follow-up) for focal pancreatic lesions. Meta-analyses, reviews, and studies focusing solely on      
complications or non-imaging biomarkers were excluded. Key exclusion categories included: meta-analyses (205, 274),     
complication/safety studies (272, 279, 292), non-imaging biomarker studies (242, 243, 248, 281, 286), review            
articles/commentaries (235, 260, 268, 278, 285), wrong population (247 - breast cancer), and management/outcome studies 
not focused on diagnostic accuracy (201, 227, 261).")                                                                   
                                                                                                                        
