│ reference lists.cochranelibrary.com"}, {"study_index": 387, "title": "Preoperative cyst fluid analysis is useful for │
│ the differential‐diagnosis of cystic lesions of the pancreas", "abstract": "BACKGROUND/AIMS It has been suggested    │
│ that activity of pancreatic enzymes and concentrations of tumoral markers in cyst fluid may help to distinguish      │
│ pseudocyst, serous, and mucinous cystadenomas. The aim of this study was to prospectively assess the reliability of  │
