│ and differentiation of solid pancreatic tumors. METHODS From 300 patients with pancreatic lesions investigated using │
│ contrast-enhanced endoscopic ultrasound we could finally include 93 patients with an undetermined, solitary,         │
│ predominantly solid, lesion 40 mm or less, and a definite histologically proven diagnosis. After bolus injection of  │
│ the contrast agent SHU 508A 4 g (400 mg/dL) the vascular pattern of the lesion during the arterial phase was         │
