│ (PPV, NPV) for EUS-FNA, CEH-EUS, and the ANN. RESULTS After excluding all of the recordings that did not meet the    │
│ technical and procedural criteria, 112 cases of PC\xa0and 55 cases of CP were included. EUS-FNA was performed in 129 │
