  "task_outcome_short": "\nScreening of studies 301-400 completed successfully.\nTotal studies screened: 100\nStudies 
included: 75 (75%)\nStudies excluded: 25 (25%)\n\nKey inclusion criteria met: Cross-sectional diagnostic accuracy 
studies using CT/MRI/PET/EUS/EUS-elastography/EUS-FNA vs histopathology reference standard in people with focal 
pancreatic lesions.\n",
  "task_outcome_detailed": "\nDETAILED SCREENING RESULTS FOR STUDIES 301-400:\n\nSUMMARY STATISTICS:\n- Total studies 
screened: 100\n- Studies INCLUDED: 75\n- Studies EXCLUDED: 25\n\nINCLUDED STUDIES (75 total):\nThese studies met the 
selection criteria as cross-sectional diagnostic accuracy studies evaluating imaging modalities (CT, MRI, PET, EUS, 
EUS-elastography, or EUS-FNA) against histopathological reference standards in patients with focal pancreatic 
lesions.\n\nMajor categories of included studies:\n1. CT-based studies (studies 301, 302, 306, 307, 310, 315, 327, 335, 
337, 341, 348, 350, 351, 360, 361, 377, 378, 379, 390, 397)\n2. MRI-based studies (studies 301, 313, 315, 338, 341, 343,
