│ 35\xa0mm at CT (p\xa0=\xa00.39). EUS and CT had comparable sensitivity, specificity, negative predictive value,      │
│ positive predictive value and accuracy for all cyst types and locations. CONCLUSIONS CT and EUS measurements are not │
│ significantly different to pathological size following resection of pancreatic cystic lesions. CT and EUS are        │
