│ cystadenoma (median value of 3,254 in IPMN (n= 29) and 1,882 in Mucinous cystadenoma (MC)(n= 4), AUC                 │
│ 0.43).Lippincott Williams & Wilkins"}, {"study_index": 595, "title": "Volumetric and morphological analysis of       │
│ intraductal papillary mucinous neoplasm of the pancreas using computed tomography and magnetic resonance imaging",   │
│ "abstract": "OBJECTIVE The purpose of this study was to predict the malignancy of intraductal papillary mucinous     │
│ neoplasm (IPMN) based on data obtained by computed tomography and magnetic resonance imaging. METHODS Sixty-nine     │
│ patients with IPMN underwent computed tomography, magnetic resonance imaging, and surgery. The tumors were           │
