│ main pancreatic duct dilatation were observed more frequently in PC than in f-AIP. CONCLUSION Speckled enhancement   │
│ inside an f-AIP lesion on pancreatic phase DCE-T1WI was useful for differentiation from PC."}, {"study_index": 696,  │
│ "title": "Improved early diagnosis of cystadenocarcinoma of the pancreas", "abstract": "BackgroundCystadenocarcinoma │
│ of the pancreas is insensitive to radiotherapy and chemotherapy, and surgery is at present the definitive treatment. │
