│ criteria, it is a superior modality for the detection of nodal metastases. While providing accurate diagnosis of     │
│ pancreatic and perirectal malignancies, results suggest the technique is less useful for intramural lesions."},      │
│ {"study_index": 699, "title": "Fine‐needle aspiration cytology of intraductal papillary mucinous tumors of the       │
│ pancreas", "abstract": "BACKGROUND Intraductal papillary mucinous tumors (IPMT) account for 5% of pancreatic         │
