│ are poorly standardized. METHODS Eleven consecutive cases of surgically proven IPMT with previous endoscopic         │
│ ultrasonography (EUS)-guided FNAB were collected for retrospective analysis. EUS-FNAB had been performed with        │
│ on-site attendance of a cytopathologist in all cases. Macroscopic and microscopic appearance of mucin, cellular type │
